# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Keep this .gitignore itself.
!.gitignore

# Keep the requirements document (level 1 source of truth).
!TF_2026_Requerimientos_KLUKA_JORGE.md

# Keep the diagrams folder (level 2 and level 3 sources of truth).
# The directory has to be re-included first, otherwise git never descends
# into it and its contents stay excluded.
!Diagramas/
!Diagramas/**
